## 22. Acceptance criteria

The POC is complete when all of the following are true:

- [ ] project installs with `uv sync`;
- [ ] only `pynput` and `PyYAML` are external runtime dependencies;
- [ ] YAML expansion rules load correctly;
- [ ] a global keyboard listener starts on Windows;
- [ ] `\\a` can expand to `testtesttest`;
- [ ] replacement works in Notepad;
- [ ] replacement works in a Chromium browser text field;
- [ ] replacement works in VS Code;
- [ ] user Backspace correctly updates the trigger buffer;
- [ ] injected replacement events do not recursively expand;
- [ ] trigger buffer is bounded to maximum trigger length;
- [ ] normal keystrokes are never logged or persisted;
- [ ] invalid YAML/config fails before listener startup;
- [ ] Ctrl+C exits cleanly.

